WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.583
Set the frame on the slope. Let the stone settle.

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:08.583
Mark the bar where the string crosses.

00:00:08.583 --> 00:00:14.292
Turn the frame. Each foot takes the exact spot where the other one stood.

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:18.125
Let the stone settle. Mark again.

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:21.625
Halfway between the two marks is level.

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:28.083
Keep one foot at its peg. Move the other until the string reaches the level mark.

00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:31.333
Both feet are now at the same height.
